---

<section class="py-24 md:py-32 px-4 md:px-8 bg-surface">
  <div class="max-w-screen-2xl mx-auto">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 md:gap-16">
      <!-- Story -->
      <div data-aos="fade-right" class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-center space-y-8 pr-0 lg:pr-12">
        <span class="font-label text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest text-sm">The Genesis</span>
        <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl md:text-5xl text-primary leading-tight">
          Curating the unseen, preserving the sublime.
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-6 text-on-surface-variant font-body font-light leading-loose text-base md:text-lg">
          <p>
            BBM Tours was born far from the boardroom—on an untrodden jungle trail where the air hummed with
            the spirit of the island. We discovered that Bali's true luxury isn't found in crowded resorts,
            but in rare, quiet encounters: the intoxicating scent of frangipani at first light, the distant
            rhythm of gamelan echoing across emerald terraces, and the profound warmth of local artisans.
          </p>
          <p>
            We established BBM Tours to offer these transformative experiences with uncompromising elegance
            and responsibility. Our pioneering eco-tourism model guarantees that every bespoke journey not
            only indulges the senses but fiercely protects the island's exquisite heritage for generations to come.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Mission Card -->
      <div data-aos="fade-left" data-aos-delay="100" class="lg:col-span-5 relative">
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-lg p-8 md:p-14 shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(26,28,27,0.06)] h-full flex flex-col justify-center relative overflow-hidden border border-outline-variant/15">
          <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 -mr-16 -mt-16 opacity-5 pointer-events-none select-none">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size:200px">eco</span>
          </div>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary-container text-4xl mb-6">volunteer_activism</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl md:text-3xl text-primary mb-4 italic">
            "Elevated Experiences, Conscious Footprints"
          </h3>
          <p class="font-body text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Our mission transcends traditional hospitality. We design exquisitely personalized, sustainable
            travel narratives that honor the delicate local ecology and actively enrich the communities that
            welcome us. Every curated itinerary is a masterclass in authentic, conscious connection.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
